From 201f0ea7d4032948b44651d45022b9becab78f25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:22:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Keep Manager publication atomic and owner-scoped

Constraint: Manager must publish the complete 34-field contract without adding a Binder broker.
Rejected: Direct per-property writes from app code | would split validation and transaction authority.
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Keep generation checks and read-back verification inside r0dump_FusionConfig.
Tested: Targeted Framework production build, source contracts, and live publication/recovery matrix.
Not-tested: FrameworksCoreTests remains blocked by unrelated lock-screen test compile errors.
Change-Id: I17a90fd4b3e89833fa074f169aa56c4b83e9f879
---
